  {
   "type": "events",
   "id": "589169",
   "attributes": {
    "id": 589169,
    "title": "IEEE Information Sessions ",
    "description": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Session 1: Information Table&nbsp; &nbsp;10:30 -12:00&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Visit the IEEE Information Table in the <strong>Buell Atrium</strong>. Brian Ryckman from IEEE will answer your questions about IEEE and the IEEE Xplore database. Pick up <strong>free IEEE swag</strong>!</span></p>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: small;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Session 2: Career and Interview Preparation&nbsp; &nbsp;12:30 - 1:30&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">&nbsp;<a name=\"m_6554921465172825080_m_-7292059091284757478__Hlk242456586\"></a>Head to the <strong>Library</strong> for the IEEE presentation on using IEEE Xplore as a career and interview preparation resource. Increase your awareness of current trends and innovations.</span></p>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: small;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Session 3: Publishing with IEEE&nbsp; &nbsp;2:30-3:30&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Are you interested in publishing with IEEE? Attend this session in the <strong>Library</strong> for tips on preparing your manuscript and navigating the submission process to get your work published. Q &amp; A included.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"https://events.vtools.ieee.org/vtools_ui/media/display/977eac1e-f066-49f8-bf05-596474432f66\" alt=\"\" width=\"1700\" height=\"2200\"></p>",
